[agent:result]   real-time and efficient approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) search queries.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   There are 2 types of AI Search indexes: - **Delta Sync Index**: An index that
[agent:result]   automatically syncs with a source Delta Table, automatically and incrementally
[agent:result]   updating the index as the underlying data in the Delta Table changes. -
[agent:result]   **Direct Vector Access Index**: An index that supports direct read and write
[agent:result]   of vectors and metadata through our REST and SDK APIs. With this model, the
[agent:result]   user manages index updates.
